            <h2>Flight Schedule & Frequency</h2>
            <h3>Daily Chicago to Greece Flight Timings</h3>
            <p>Flight schedules between Chicago and Greece vary depending on the airline, season, and whether the journey is nonstop or includes a connection. The busiest travel period is generally from late spring through early autumn, when airlines increase services to meet Mediterranean holiday demand.</p>

